isql tool was used to load triples from .nt files (15 files).

sudo docker exec -it trusting_shaw /bin/bash
 cd /opt/virtuoso-opensource/bin
 sudo ./isql 1111
For example the following SQL script loads data for saarland:

delete from DB.DBA.LOAD_LIST;
 commit work; 
 ld_add('/rdfGer/saarland.nt','lgd');
 rdf_loader_run ();
 checkpoint;

URL: https://dice-llm-api.cs.uni-paderborn.de/v1

List the available models:
curl --location 'https://dice-llm-api.cs.uni-paderborn.de/v1/models' --header 'Authorization: Bearer <your-api-key>'

And then query any of the models by using our generic alias or their specific ID like this:
curl --location 'https://dice-llm-api.cs.uni-paderborn.de/v1/chat/completions' \
--header 'Authorization: Bearer <your-api-key>' \
--header 'Content-Type: application/json' \
--data '{
 "model": "general-purpose",
 "messages": [
 {
 "role": "user",
 "content": "Why is sky blue?"
 }
 ]
}'

